1
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:42,800
This is

2
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:45,800
the story of Marat.

3
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:50,200
It's ruined. I can't write anymore.

4
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:53,360
Do you think we should write this story?

5
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,160
Using his death

6
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:56,520
as material.

7
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,520
If I write it out,

8
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,480
half the credit is yours.

9
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,720
I thought only someone with Sophie's personality

10
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,520
would do something like murder.

11
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:25,200
I didn't expect the knife An'an gave to Mr. Dai

12
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:26,530
to be the murder weapon.

13
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,760
But people don't commit crimes for no reason.

14
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:32,020
There must be a motive.

15
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,560
Let's stall them first,

16
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:35,090
and keep them in a good mood.

17
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:36,120
Xiaotao.

18
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:38,680
Keeping two women in a good mood at the same time

19
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,160
is harder than reaching the sky.

20
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,890
I can't just sit and wait to die.

21
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,680
We have to get down the mountain quickly.

22
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,210
Brother.

23
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,200
We can't just leave like this.

24
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:47,079
It's not just about me.

25
00:02:47,079 --> 00:02:48,760
Don't you want the Xinghe Award anymore?

26
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,920
Even if we're going down the mountain,

27
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:52,520
we have to explain everything to Mr. Dai first.

28
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:56,760
Actually, I've already talked to Mr. Dai.

29
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:57,620
Did you tell him

30
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,200
that my name can be added?

31
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:00,730
I'm sorry, Xiaotao.

32
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,320
The book has already been printed,

33
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,960
and the original contract has been signed.

34
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,960
The award ceremony is tomorrow.

35
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,400
Adding someone now would be a breach of contract.

36
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,860
We'd have to withdraw from the competition.

37
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Then let's withdraw.

38
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,200
I can't add your name.

39
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,980
I'm also very sad about it.

40
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:25,160
Even though we wrote the book for the Xinghe Award in the first place.

41
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:28,720
It's fine.

42
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,880
Let's wait until the award ceremony is over tomorrow

43
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:33,010
and see if there's any way to remedy it.

44
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,079
Xiaotao,

45
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,460
you have to know

46
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,200
that if I die,

47
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:39,460
there will be no possibility of a remedy.

48
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,960
Is it that hard to admit that I'm the original co-author?

49
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:45,800
Do you know how much effort I put into writing that book?

50
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,560
Forget it.

51
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:49,440
Let's go down the mountain first.

52
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:56,720
Mr. Dai.

53
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,800
Zhiwei, where did you go?

54
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,880
I've been looking for you for ages.

55
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:02,280
The judges of the Xinghe Award just called.

56
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,320
They want us to make a decision quickly.

57
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:05,850
Take the money or the award?

58
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,360
You can only keep one.

59
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:09,290
Mr. Dai, I've signed the contract.

60
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:11,600
The copyright details will be as you said.

61
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:13,860
We need to go down the mountain right now.

62
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,120
Go down the mountain?

63
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:15,920
Wait a minute.

64
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,760
The road down the mountain is closed,

65
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:19,880
and the boats have stopped.

66
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:22,000
Some of my buddies almost had an accident going down just now.

67
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,880
In this thunderstorm,

68
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,760
be careful not to get struck by lightning

69
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:25,820
and lose your life.

70
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:26,960
Closed?

71
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:28,680
Impossible.

72
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:30,760
Up to level 10.

73
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:35,200
It matches the plot in my book again.

74
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,760
Am I really going to die here?

75
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,740
What's wrong with you?

76
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,360
Take a rest first.

77
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,159
Let's wait and see.

78
00:04:46,159 --> 00:04:46,760
All right.

79
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,360
Zhiwei.

80
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,120
Are you not feeling well?

81
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:55,890
I have a suggestion.

82
00:04:56,159 --> 00:04:57,880
Since today is the book launch

83
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,280
and our great writer is here,

84
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:01,480
let's have him sign a copy for each of us.

85
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:03,880
Otherwise, when he becomes famous later,

86
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,920
if we want to find him,

87
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:05,980
we won't be able to.

88
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,520
I already have one.

89
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,000
It's a manuscript.

90
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,040
Do you remember the inscription you wrote?

91
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,500
You might have forgotten.

92
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:16,040
But what I'm more interested in is

93
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:18,240
how the author knows so many details.

94
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:21,240
Could there be some hidden secret

95
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:22,900
between them and Mara?

96
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,610
Some hidden secret?

97
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:27,880
What kind of gimmick is this?

98
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,560
Tell us more.

99
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:32,900
Everything that needs to be said is already in the book.

100
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,000
Zhiwei,

101
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:35,440
what's wrong?

102
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:37,540
Are you still feeling unwell?

103
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:39,540
Mr. Dai.

104
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:42,460
Is there any other way down the mountain?

105
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:44,600
We need to get down the mountain and leave the island right now.

106
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,659
It's not safe here.

107
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:46,930
What do you mean?

108
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:48,960
The contract is signed.

109
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:50,560
Are we no longer friends?

110
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,560
Why are you in such a hurry to leave?

111
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,880
That's not what I meant.

112
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:55,040
But the mountain is closed due to a thunderstorm warning.

113
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:57,680
It would be dangerous to go down the mountain rashly right now.

114
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,440
But it's more dangerous to stay here.

115
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:01,400
You didn't dare to tell us Mala's story.

116
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,800
And you lied that it's dangerous not to go down the mountain.

117
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,680
Li Zhiwei, what are you hiding?

118
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,880
What are you faking? What are you afraid of?

119
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,880
What am I hiding? What am I afraid of?

120
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:08,440
Mala, Mala.

121
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:10,080
You keep talking about Mala.

122
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,860
The point is that I will die here tonight.

123
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,000
Brother, calm down.

124
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,760
This note...

125
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:22,040
Someone copied my handwriting.

126
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,400
I never wrote it.

127
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,440
I checked.

128
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:26,970
There was no knife under the pillow at all.

129
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,360
This knife...

130
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,800
Why is it here?

131
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,680
This knife is our family's brand.

132
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:36,420
I gave it to Uncle Dai as a gift.

133
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:37,760
I meant no harm.

134
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:38,480
Right.

135
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,280
Okay.

136
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,880
Let's not talk about the knife for now.

137
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:42,010
What about Xiaofei?

138
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:44,810
What does this have to do with my poor Xiaofei?

139
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:47,480
What?

140
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:51,720
Xiaofei.

141
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,360
You cut its stomach open.

142
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,560
What are you doing?

143
00:06:58,440 --> 00:06:59,370
It's an autopsy.

144
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,040
I checked.

145
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,850
There was only cake in Xiaofei's stomach,

146
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,490
and it wasn't digested yet.

147
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:08,220
Xiaofei died after eating the cake here.

148
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:08,880
Why

149
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:11,410
could only the cake in my hand poison Xiaofei?

150
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,120
An'an returning to the country,

151
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,160
Xiaofei's death,

152
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,720
and this note.

153
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:19,640
Why did all this happen tonight of all nights?

154
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,760
If there is no sixth person here,

155
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:23,720
then the murderer

156
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,520
is among the five of us.

157
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,560
So,

158
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,320
you're suspecting me now.

159
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,720
I made the cake.

160
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:34,240
I brought the knife.

161
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,520
Things happened after I returned.

162
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,320
That's not what I meant.

163
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:43,320
Tomorrow is the Xinghe Awards.

164
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:45,159
I just want to survive tonight.

165
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,240
I know you hate me.

166
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,159
You leave when you want,

167
00:07:51,159 --> 00:07:52,360
and come back when you want.

168
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,280
And you,

169
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,080
you want my film and television copyrights

170
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,480
without giving me a penny.

171
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,680
Fine, take it all.

172
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,240
And you,

173
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:02,410
you want me to suffer

174
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:04,090
to prove that I love you.

175
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,080
Fine, okay.

176
00:08:05,080 --> 00:08:06,520
I can prove it to you.

177
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,280
And you.

178
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,560
Bro, I...

179
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,570
You're my good brother.

180
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,450
I have nothing to scold you for.

181
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,960
I've worked hard for ten years. Why?

182
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:20,360
I've worked hard writing for ten years.

183
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,880
I've kept writing for ten years.

184
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:24,080
It wasn't easy to get to where I am today.

185
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:26,120
Let me succeed just once.

186
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,160
Even just once.

187
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,120
People can't always fail

188
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:33,100
and never succeed, right?

189
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,159
Bro.

190
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:40,200
I'm sorry.

191
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:43,210
I shouldn't have come back.

192
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:45,600
An'an.

193
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:49,320
Li Zhiwei.

194
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,700
You're the one who's really sick.

195
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,640
No, let's just eat.

196
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,280
What are you doing?

197
00:08:58,280 --> 00:09:01,010
We're just having a meal together. You have to...

198
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:06,960
Bro.

199
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:10,760
I thought you were just overthinking earlier.

200
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,480
But now you're really dead.

201
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:20,360
Does this place look familiar?

202
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:25,000
Everything tonight is arranged according to the descriptions in your book.

203
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:29,440
Mr. Dai.

204
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:33,210
Is this really the only way down the mountain and off the island?

205
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,600
It's the only way.
